<title>USA: Med Resources names William Farrell Pres.</title>
<headline>Med Resources names William Farrell Pres.</headline>
<dateline>HACKENSACK, N.J. 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medical Resources Inc said Thursday it had appointed William Farrell as president and re-appointed him as chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Farrell has been with the company since 1984 serving in several executive capacities, most recently as co-president and chief operating officer.</p>
